# app: whatsapp
# Replying (COMPANION.md 7.2): Reply in a conversation whose notification has a reply action, the reply screen with typing and
# Paste (the clipboard holds a game score), the confirmation sheet, and the push of the encrypted reply to the relay (fixture
# ha.example.test answers 200): "Sent to your phone" and back to the conversation.
wait 1500
shot whatsapp-send-list
tap 270 178             # Family (3)
wait 900
tap 270 918             # Reply
wait 900
shot whatsapp-compose
expect-state chars=0
type See you at six
wait 600
tap 472 924             # Enter: a line feed
wait 300
tap 78 504              # Paste: "Somdoku 12:34, no mistakes"
wait 900
expect-state chars=41
shot whatsapp-compose-typed
tap 400 504             # Send: always a confirmation first
wait 900
shot whatsapp-confirm
tap 270 812             # Send in the sheet: the relay takes it
wait 1500
shot whatsapp-sent
